1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,006
AI will have you thinking you’re cooking.

2
00:00:04,156 --> 00:00:06,646
You tell it your business idea…

3
00:00:06,646 --> 00:00:08,449
and suddenly everything’s brilliant.

4
00:00:08,599 --> 00:00:10,807
Your strategy makes sense.

5
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:12,602
Your plan is solid.

6
00:00:12,602 --> 00:00:14,620
You’re about to change the world.

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,796
Meanwhile…

8
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:18,712
you ain’t sold a damn thing.

9
00:00:19,412 --> 00:00:24,039
Look, AI can help you build an idea.

10
00:00:24,089 --> 00:00:27,066
But agreement ain’t validation.

11
00:00:27,766 --> 00:00:31,613
So stop asking it, “Is this a good idea?”

12
00:00:31,813 --> 00:00:33,848
Ask it, “Why would this fail?”

13
00:00:34,248 --> 00:00:36,193
“Who actually pays for this?”

14
00:00:36,593 --> 00:00:40,650
“What am I assuming that I haven’t proven?”

15
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,500
And my favorite…

16
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,401
“Make the strongest argument against my plan.”

17
00:00:47,001 --> 00:00:51,001
The point isn’t getting a machine to tell you you’re right.

18
00:00:51,101 --> 00:00:54,365
It’s using the machine to get better at thinking.

19
00:00:54,915 --> 00:00:57,745
Quiet Bands. Build what matters.

